%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
I bent my knees, seized Toko's cheeks with both of my\nhands, and...%K%P
我弯下膝盖，两手停在都子的双颊上…%K%P
...lightly pressed my lips against her forehead.%K%P
用嘴唇，轻轻碰了下那光滑的额头。%K%P
Toko regarded me with misty eyes as I slowly drew\nbackwards.%K%P
都子用模糊的眼神，\n盯着又一次离开的我，看了好一会。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIs this... your answer...?\d%K%P
「这就是…答案么？」%K%P
Her expression was almost indescribable, reflecting\nneither joy nor sorrow. Similarly, the tone of her nasal\nvoice was neither accusatory nor appreciative.%K%P
既不是笑颜也不是哭脸，\n既没有责备我也没有褒奖我，\n带着鼻音的微妙呢喃，从都子的嘴里发出来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Sorry. I know this isn't what you wanted.\d%K%P
「…对不起。\n我知道跟都子所说的不太一样」%K%P
And yet, that alone was enough to make my heart beat so\nfast I felt it might burst at any second.%K%P
但就算是这种程度的事，\n我的心脏都已经跳动得快要炸裂了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut... I can't just change the way I feel about you that\neasily.\d%K%P
「但是…我一直以来对都子爱的方式，\n是不会如此轻易就改变的」%K%P
This was the farthest I could go here.%K%P
再往上的关系，我也不想达到。%K%P
I couldn't suddenly disavow the paternal feelings that I\nbelieved had been driving me up until now.%K%P
一直以来我都这样认为。\n想要守护都子，这样的爱是无法否定的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo... that means you prefer Ms. Kouno, then?\d%K%P
「你果然，还是喜欢老师？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI've said this a million times, but... if I had to choose\nwhich of you was more important to me, I'd pick you\nwithout any hesitation.\d%K%P
「说过很多遍了啊…\n要问哪边才是最优先的话，毫无疑问是都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
That was one of my personal rules, and I had yet to break\nit ever since moving in here.%K%P
这是到这里生活以来，\n从来没有变过的，我的原则。%K%P
I believed that the affection I had been accumulating as\nher guardian would never betray me.%K%P
我也相信，一直以来积攒下来的，作为被监护人的爱，\n是绝对不会背叛我的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut if you want any kind of deeper meaning from that\nstatement, well... I'm sorry, but it's not easy for me to\nsay.\d%K%P
「但是，要说这句话是什么意思的话，\n那个，怎么说呢…抱歉，没有办法简单作回答」%K%P
I met Toko through my infatuation with Ms. Honoka...\nI had been betraying her ever since the day I first saw\nher.%K%P
是因为穗香小姐，才和都子相识…\n从最开始，我就背叛了都子。%K%P
And my ambiguous relationship with Asami was most likely\nsomething that made her incredibly uncomfortable as well.%K%P
虽然跟都子一起生活，\n但麻实的事，到现在也没能从脑子里拂去。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHave you... changed your mind about me?\d%K%P
「对我的期待，破灭了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Now that's a surprise. I never knew you had such awful\ntaste.\d%K%P
「…吓了一跳。\n你的审美还真是挺独特的」%K%P
Toko had been exposed to the miserable sides of adults on\na daily basis, yet for some reason, she answered them with\nfeelings that were the complete opposite of what they\nshould have been.%K%P
向罪魁祸首坦陈自己的思念，\n让大人反复看到自己刻意回避的东西，\n真是最不相称的一类啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...No kidding. I guess I really do have awful taste. I\ncan't believe you're the only one who made me feel this\nway.\d%K%P
「………说的是啊。\n审美，是独特。\n除了理君，就没有考虑过别人呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
Yet she still refused to let it go.%K%P
但是，终究还是没法打马虎眼。%K%P
Even if this infatuation was no more than a temporary,\nfever-like state, the fact it weighed so heavy on her was\napparent even to me.%K%P
就像是一直在感冒发烧，\n但却并不会转化成重症一样，持续的难受。%K%P
Was I actually... a malignant swindler without even\nrealizing it?%K%P
我…难道是个不得了的欺诈师？%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou really are chicken, Osamu. Can't even answer me\ndirectly. You wuss. We would've been better off if you\njust came out and said you hated me.\d%K%P
「果然理君是个胆小鬼。\n是个优柔寡断、首鼠两端的家伙。\n你直接说『我讨厌你』不就好了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's ridiculous... Even if it damned me to hellfire, I\ncould never lie to you like that.\d%K%P
「不要…\n就算坠到无间地狱去，我也不要撒这个谎」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Dumbass. That's exactly what hurts me the most. I've\nbeen trying to tell you all this time.\d%K%P
「………笨蛋。\n我都说这样会让我很难受的了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm so sorry... I truly am.\d%K%P
「对不起…\n真的很对不起」%K%P
By maintaining my dignity, all I did was force her into a\ncorner.%K%P
我越退缩，\n都子就越是穷追不舍。%K%P
It wasn't supposed to turn out like this... I'd sworn to\nstay by her side and make her happy, and yet...%K%P
不该是这样的…\n我明明是为了都子的幸福才在这里的啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo, it's okay...\nYou gave me a kiss, so I'm satisfied...\d%K%P
「不，算了…\n也亲过我了，可以了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou love me. And that's why you kissed me. ...For now,\nthat's how I'll interpret things.\d%K%P
「理君也喜欢我。\n因为喜欢，才会亲我。\n…现在我就这么认为，然后接受这一点吧」%K%P
Yet Toko managed to endure something that was nothing\nshort of a betrayal on my part, going so far as to try and\nfind some small comfort in it.%K%P
即使这样，\n都子也忍受了我这么残酷的行为，\n感受到些许点滴的幸福。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAre you going to tell me that's out of line, too?\d%K%P
「这一点…也不可以么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOf course not...\d%K%P
「怎么可能呢…」%K%P
She matured enough to be this sensitive to the muddled,\nambiguous feelings of adults.%K%P
因为她是过于作为一个成年人被养育的，\n所以成年人那种复杂的感情变得敏感起来了。%K%P
At the same time, though, she found solace in her own\nchildish reasoning -- that she had yet to lose despite the\ncomplexity of the situation.%K%P
都子拼命拿出了孩子般的理论——『我还没输』。%K%P
And I unconditionally validated it for her.%K%P
我全部都肯定了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu... I can still manage. I'll try to get my act\ntogether over the next week.\d%K%P
「理君…我会加油的。\n还有一个星期，一定恢复到原来水平」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOkay...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
