「所以理君…一定好好看着我。\n成为支撑我心底的力量吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI will... I will...\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd if I pass... either accept my feelings or turn me\ndown, okay?\d%K%P
「然后，要是合格了的话…\n能不能承认我…然后，离开我？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...!\d%K%P
「额…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dPromise me.\nPromise me that you'll view Ms. Kouno and I as equals.\d%K%P
「就这样最好了。\n把我放在天平上老师的对侧吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA...All right.\d%K%P
「啊………好」%K%P
Nothing was all right. Not even close.%K%P
真是，一点也不『好』。%K%P
Rejecting Toko felt like an impossible notion.\nI couldn't possibly view her in the same light as others.%K%P
离开都子的选项，对我来说是不存在的。\n都子也不可能成为别人比较的对象。%K%P
But...%K%P
但是…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIn that case... let's continue with our study sessions. I\nneed to brush up on my math, for starters.\d%K%P
「那…接着来学习吧？\n首先是数学，不能不使劲了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah... That's right.\nWe only have a week left, don't we?\d%K%P
「嗯…就是。\n后面只有一个星期了」%K%P
I had ruled in favor of a momentary truce over a\ndefinitive solution. Maybe Toko really was right about me\nbeing chicken...%K%P
选择了暂时的安稳，\n我果然如都子所说，是个优柔寡断、首鼠两端的胆小鬼。%K%P
